Atheros ath9k-htc Firmware Files
==================================

This directory should contain firmware binaries for Atheros AR7010 and AR9271 USB 802.11n NICs.

Required firmware files:
  - ar7010.fw    (AR7010 USB/PCIe SoC firmware)
  - ar9271.fw    (AR9271 USB/Wifi SoC firmware)

To obtain these firmware binaries:

1. Build from source (open-ath9k-htc-firmware):
   - Requires Xtensa compiler toolchain
   - Source: /sources/open-ath9k-htc-firmware/
   - Run: make toolchain && make -C target_firmware

2. Or download from Linux kernel firmware repository:
   - https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/firmware/linux-firmware.git/
   - Path: ath9k_htc/ar7010.fw and ath9k_htc/ar9271.fw

The kernel ath9k driver will load these at runtime when an ath9k device is detected.
